#! console --size 120x34
# A right-click on a reply opens its menu; with two panes each title carries its close mark.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
type hello menu
key enter
wait-frame 30000 faux:
wait-idle 15000
mouse right 14 5
wait-frame 3000 Copy as
snap menu
key down
key right
wait-frame 3000 Plain text
snap submenu
key esc
key esc
key alt-v
wait-frame 5000 ✕
snap closer
quit
